Third-party components

* repos/AniMerPlus/ is the official AniMer+ repository, included as a git
  submodule under its own MIT license (see repos/AniMerPlus/LICENSE). This
  repository does not modify its source; see repos/patches/ for the single
  configuration patch applied at setup time.
* The 17x17 taxonomic distance matrices under data/phylogeny/ were built from
  the IOC/Clements Linnaean ranks (data/phylogeny/build_distance_matrix.py).
* CUB-200-2011, CowBird and CtrlAVES3D are not redistributed; obtain them
  from their original sources (see README.md).
